{"name": "PinKeep", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master the Flippers</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/cf1019afd8d182817d2859f63b1532c4.poster.avif?t=1785225570\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/cf1019afd8d182817d2859f63b1532c4.webm?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/cf1019afd8d182817d2859f63b1532c4.mp4?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your flippers to collect resources and damage the enemies that swarm your keep. Master your ball control to hit shield bearers from behind, deliver resources to traders or take full advantage of the structures you built. Flick the ball precisely where you want it to go with a Force Push.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Draw and Build</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/6aa51c4b4902f239053a3d290bc6ef4d.poster.avif?t=1785225570\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/6aa51c4b4902f239053a3d290bc6ef4d.webm?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/6aa51c4b4902f239053a3d290bc6ef4d.mp4?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw structures from your deck and place them on the playing field to improve your defenses and give yourself advantages - you\u2019re going to need them! Place villages that provide passive income, warrior outposts that attack knights for you, additional flippers to handle your ball and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Expand and Upgrade</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/56eb163668d087f09675c3a75d7c3e16.poster.avif?t=1785225570\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/56eb163668d087f09675c3a75d7c3e16.webm?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/56eb163668d087f09675c3a75d7c3e16.mp4?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In between fights, spend your spare coin to acquire new cards to add to your deck for the run, or upgrade your stats (Melee, Ranged, Development, Population, Alchemy, Ball Damage) to improve your buildings\u2019 effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose your Path</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/9d93bde5df2370021bf7a6dca43f20d4.poster.avif?t=1785225570\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/9d93bde5df2370021bf7a6dca43f20d4.webm?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/9d93bde5df2370021bf7a6dca43f20d4.mp4?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your next challenge, head to a workshop for repairs, or trigger a story event. You might even learn something about how your motley band of Kneblins got into this mess to begin with\u2026 and what strange environment they\u2019re now finding themselves in. If you proceed far enough, you can take it up with the big bad of the area and move on to the next region!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create Synergies and Production Chains</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/30c43ed44d2af55409af517f5e2ba13c.poster.avif?t=1785225570\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/30c43ed44d2af55409af517f5e2ba13c.webm?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/extras/30c43ed44d2af55409af517f5e2ba13c.mp4?t=1785225570\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate powerful synergies in your deck over time: Whether you collect iron with your ball, deliver it to a blacksmith and upgrade other buildings\u2019 melee capacities, build arrow makers to buff your gates and arrow towers or place resin storage and fire pits for explosive interactions, clever combinations will lead you to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A Pinball-based Tower Defense Roguelite! Weaponize your flippers to defend your Keep against hordes of knights. Build bumpers, spinners and other contraptions to discover mighty combos and powerful synergies!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143700/35ef6aa23a7ea94cfb3315b8e8d86a3c63aba913/header.jpg?t=1785225570", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelite", "Tower Defense", "Pinball", "Medieval", "Physics", "Arcade"], "developers": "Okomotive", "publishers": "Okomotive", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4143700", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 January 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/w6GpeFXjqGg", "first_seen": 1769126400.0, "review_rank": 1350}